  "loc": "Abstract, p.1; Section 2.1, p.7",
  "quote": "social welfare orders, on the set of infinite utility streams",
  "note": "The paper studies social welfare orders ranking infinite intergenerational utility streams (intergenerational equity: representability and constructibility under anonymity and Pareto-type axioms). No agents submit ballots or other inputs, and no voting procedure is analysed. This is welfare-ordering theory, not aggregation by voting. Coding stopped per C0."
